<!--
  1.7-only (loadFolders 1.7/Patches). Tags industrial WD content with minTechLevel for Medieval mode.
  Do NOT put minTechLevel in Common/Defs/ — the frozen 1.6 DLL has no such fields and will XML-error.
  Each op is Conditional so MayRequire defs (VCHE / BoR) missing offline do not error.
-->
